  "content": "# 第30题\n\n**题型**: 选择题\n\n**难度**: ★★★☆☆\n\n**分值**: 2分\n\n---\n\n## 题目内容\n\n30. What can we learn from this passage?\n\n## 选项\n\nA. A. The signatories may change the biophysical limits.\n\nB. B. The author agrees with the message of the poem.\n\nC. C. The issue of collapse is being prioritized.\n\nD. D. The global collapse is well underway.\n\n---\n\n## 参考答案\n\nB\n\n",
  "answer": "C",
  "analysis": "本题考查连词。although虽然；unless除非；because因为；so所以。前后是因果关系，故选C。"
